684
00:45:27.558 --> 00:45:29.435
-Kamangha-manghang. Nagtitinda sila ng abalones dito.
-Ay naku.

685
00:45:29.518 --> 00:45:30.936
-Abalones?
-Kailangan nating mag-order nito.

686
00:45:31.019 --> 00:45:32.438
-Isa bawat mesa.
-Magandang tawag.

687
00:45:32.521 --> 00:45:33.355
Napakaganda nito.

688
00:45:41.864 --> 00:45:42.781
Maghintay ka.

689
00:45:42.865 --> 00:45:46.577
Dapat inimbitahan natin si Mr. Kim at Ms. Yu.

690
00:45:46.660 --> 00:45:48.078
Pinagtulungan naming lahat ito.

691
00:45:48.162 --> 00:45:49.204
Pareho silang busy.

692
00:45:49.288 --> 00:45:51.165
Sabi nila dadaan daw sila
kung matapos sila ng maaga.

693
00:45:51.248 --> 00:45:52.499
I wonder kung makakarating sila.

694
00:45:53.959 --> 00:45:55.752
Dapat tayong maghintay buong gabi kung kailangan.

695
00:45:55.836 --> 00:45:56.712
Dapat tayo.

696
00:46:00.591 --> 00:46:02.134
Mr. Kim! Dito.

697
00:46:04.136 --> 00:46:05.512
-Halika dito.
-Sorry?

698
00:46:05.596 --> 00:46:06.638
Ay naku.

699
00:46:09.224 --> 00:46:10.058
Ta-da!

700
00:46:10.142 --> 00:46:11.935
Ano ang lahat ng ito?

701
00:46:12.019 --> 00:46:14.146
-Ito ay isang party table para sa aking unang kaarawan.
-Ano?

702
00:46:18.650 --> 00:46:19.818
handa na ako.

703
00:46:20.944 --> 00:46:21.945
Dito na tayo.

704
00:46:23.489 --> 00:46:24.740
Pwede bang ngumiti ka ng kaunti?

705
00:46:24.823 --> 00:46:25.866
Mahusay.

706
00:46:25.949 --> 00:46:27.326
Maaari ka bang kumagat sa pagkain?

707
00:46:27.993 --> 00:46:30.245
Mahusay. Mukhang maganda yan.

708
00:46:32.623 --> 00:46:35.000
Patawarin mo ako saglit.

709
00:46:57.314 --> 00:47:00.692
JI-HYEOK

710
00:47:00.776 --> 00:47:02.152
YU HA-YEONG

711
00:47:02.236 --> 00:47:04.196
-Bakit hindi ka umiinom?
-Hindi ba napakasarap?

712
00:47:07.783 --> 00:47:09.785
