713
00:47:11.078 --> 00:47:12.454
Ito ay kahanga-hanga.

714
00:47:14.414 --> 00:47:16.542
Sino ang umiinom ng alak na parang tubig?

715
00:47:16.625 --> 00:47:17.751
nakikita mo,

716
00:47:17.834 --> 00:47:20.170
Ang ganda ng mood ko.

717
00:47:20.254 --> 00:47:22.089
Sobrang saya ko ngayon.

718
00:47:22.965 --> 00:47:25.884
-Narito ang abalone risotto at lasagna.
-Ay naku!

719
00:47:25.968 --> 00:47:28.428
-Iyan ay mukhang napakabuti.
- Oh aking kabutihan!

720
00:47:28.512 --> 00:47:30.055
