796
00:51:09.900 --> 00:51:12.569
Nagsinungaling ka pa para sa akin.

797
00:51:12.652 --> 00:51:14.613
Kailan ko ginawa iyon?

798
00:51:14.696 --> 00:51:16.198
Alam ko lahat.

799
00:51:20.368 --> 00:51:23.747
-Huwag mong sabihin sa akin--
-Paanong hindi ko mapapansin? Hindi ako tanga.

800
00:51:23.830 --> 00:51:25.207
Halika na.

801
00:51:28.335 --> 00:51:29.544
Alam mo lahat?

802
00:51:30.921 --> 00:51:31.755
lahat ng ito?

803
00:51:31.838 --> 00:51:34.132
-Kung gayon alam mo ba ang iyong asawa ay--
-Oo naman.

804
00:51:34.716 --> 00:51:35.884
Alam ko lahat.

805
00:51:38.094 --> 00:51:39.137
Sinigang na abalone.

806
00:51:39.846 --> 00:51:41.139
Ginger tea.

807
00:51:41.932 --> 00:51:44.100
Nakuha mo ang lahat ng iyon para sa akin.

808
00:51:45.185 --> 00:51:47.938
Nagsinungaling ka pa
pagiging allergic sa abalone.

809
00:51:51.900 --> 00:51:54.903
Kahit na mas maaga, sinigurado mong ilagay
lahat ng masasarap na pagkain sa harapan ko.

810
00:51:54.986 --> 00:51:57.322
