830
00:54:25.345 --> 00:54:27.138
Masyado akong lasing para tingnan ang phone ko.

831
00:54:27.222 --> 00:54:28.056
ayos lang.

832
00:54:30.809 --> 00:54:32.227
Eto na.

833
00:54:34.145 --> 00:54:36.564
Wow, tuyong pollack na sopas.

834
00:54:38.566 --> 00:54:39.943
Kumain ka rin ng kimchi, anak.

835
