848
00:55:16.980 --> 00:55:18.815
Parang kinikilig din ako...

849
00:55:20.233 --> 00:55:21.568
I find myself being swayed.

850
00:55:22.360 --> 00:55:23.486
Huwag kang mabait sa akin.

851
00:55:25.697 --> 00:55:26.614
