857
00:55:40.003 --> 00:55:40.837
Nakuha ko.

858
00:55:40.920 --> 00:55:42.422
By the way, nasaan si Mr. Gong?

859
00:55:42.505 --> 00:55:44.257
Nasa meeting siya
kasama ang pinuno ng pangkat ng CSR.

860
00:55:44.340 --> 00:55:46.509
Isinasaalang-alang ang sukat ng proyekto,

861
00:55:46.593 --> 00:55:48.094
